| **Ingestion & De-Identification** | Cloud DLP & Cloud Run | Scans HL7/FHIR payloads and clinical text for PHI/PII; replaces identifiers with salted deterministic hashes before agent processing. |
| **Triage & Extraction Agent** | Gemini Flash | High-speed structured extraction; maps unstructured doctor notes into validated Pydantic JSON schemas conforming to FHIR Resource definitions. |
| **Pharmacological RAG Agent** | Vertex AI Vector Search | Performs hybrid semantic + lexical searches across medical journals, PubMed abstracts, and FDA drug labeling guidelines. |
| **Diagnostic Synthesizer** | Gemini Pro | Employs multi-step reasoning with context-cached historical EHR records to detect subtle downward clinical trajectories (e.g., rising lactate + drop in MAP). |
| **Safety & Auditor Agent** | Gemini Flash (Temp = 0.0) | Acts as an adversarial critic. Aggressively challenges the proposed intervention against allergy profiles, CYP450 liver enzymes, and renal clearance limits. |
| **HITL Action Orchestrator** | Cloud Run, Firestore & Pub/Sub | Manages state persistence, token limits, and enforces physician cryptographic approval before any notification or EHR write-back. |

